OL,3,AEurope's car makers are in crisis. Will
OL,4,Athe threat of war rescue them?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEurope's car makers are in crisis. Will
OL,7,Fthe threat of war rescue them?
OL,9,FIt's green, bulging and intimidating.
OL,10,FFord's latest vehicle looks like a
OL,11,Fpick-up truck that has been through an
OL,12,FIncredible Hulk transformation. Based
OL,13,Fon its popular Ranger series, this
OL,14,Fbeefy number parked outside the front
OL,15,Fdoor of Ford's Dagenham plant can carry
OL,16,Fa load of two tonnes, tow up to four
OL,17,Ftonnes and is also shouldering the
OL,18,Fhopes of the 2,000-strong workforce
OL,19,Fthat still makes engines here.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
