OL,3,AEurope's car makers are in crisis. Will
OL,4,Athe threat of war rescue them?
OL,5,
OL,6,FInside the factory, the three-litre
OL,7,Fdiesel engines that will power this
OL,8,Fcamo-painted beast drift down a
OL,9,Fproduction line that has seen output
OL,10,Fcut from 90,000 engines a year to about
OL,11,Fhalf that over the last decade.
OL,13,FFord is hoping that a pivot towards
OL,14,Fmilitary vehicles can help fill the
OL,15,Fvoid created by what the company's UK
OL,16,Fboss calls the most challenging
OL,17,Fenvironment since the invention of the
OL,18,Fmotor car. Once mighty, the European
OL,19,Fcar industry is starting to look puny
OL,20,Fand is hoping surging defence budgets
OL,21,Fas Europe re-arms can help it flex its
OL,22,Findustrial muscles once more.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
